    "instructions": "Identify the grid as a lattice of cells separated by lines of a single color (the separator color). Each cell is a 2x2 block of non-separator pixels. Locate all colored 2x2 blocks (non-separator, non-zero). For each color present, find the bounding box of all cells of that color. Then, for each color, fill all cells within that bounding box with that color, but only if the cell is not a separator line. Do not change cells outside any bounding box. The output is the grid with these filled bounding boxes."
