    "instructions": "Detect the separator lines (full rows/columns of same color). The grid is divided into a matrix of 2x2 cells. Find all colored blocks. For each color, compute the axis-aligned bounding box over its cell positions. Then for each cell inside that box, set its 2x2 block to that color if it is not a separator. Output the grid."
